<title>USA: CAI Wireless Q3 shr loss $0.60 widens.</title>
<headline>CAI Wireless Q3 shr loss $0.60 widens.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, N.Y. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended December 31</p>
<p>					1996		 1995</p>
<p>Revs			 $    9,250,000    $   12,952,000</p>
<p>Oper loss			11,507,000	  13,760,000</p>
<p>Net Loss			 21,016,000	  14,586,000</p>
<p>Loss per common share		0.60		  0.45</p>
<p>Ave shrs			 40,464,356	  37,829,482</p>
<p>				 Nine Months Ended December 31</p>
<p>					 1996		1995</p>
<p>Revs			  $  27,738,000	$  20,843,000</p>
<p>Oper loss			32,996,000	   25,663,000</p>
<p>Net loss			 57,493,000	   29,800,000</p>
<p>Loss per common share		1.68		   1.40</p>
<p>Ave shrs			 39,915,020	   23,517,014</p>
<p>NOTE: Lower sales for the third quarter ended December 31, 1996 was primarily due to the spinoff of two operating systems with 1995 sales of $3,277,000 into a non-consolidated subsidiary, CS Wireless Systems Inc.</p>
<p>-- ((New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610)))</p>
</text>
